# Generates apps/api/internal/playerwrites/testdata/player.seed.sql and the cases files of the Player's own writes:
#   profile.cases.json        PATCH /api/me/profile, POST /api/me/profile-banner, POST /api/me/stats-visibility
#   privacy.cases.json        POST /api/me/{profile-visibility,directory-visibility,phone-privacy}
#   notifications.cases.json  PATCH /api/me/notifications and /api/me/notifications/{notificationId}
#   clubs.cases.json          POST /api/me/clubs, DELETE /api/me/clubs/{clubId}
#   contact.cases.json        POST /api/account/contact-change
# The cases are data; the *.golden.json files are captured from the TypeScript by capture-writes-player.test.mjs, never
# generated here. Edit this file, run `python3 apps/api/testdata/tools/gen-writes-player-cases.py`, then rerun the capture.
